@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 13.1 Manage Occasions - class diagram
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #444444
  BackgroundColor<<View>> #EADCFF
  BackgroundColor<<Controller>> #D8F3DC
  BackgroundColor<<Service>> #DCECFF
  BackgroundColor<<Repository>> #FFF1C9
  BackgroundColor<<Entity>> #E0F3E7
  BackgroundColor<<External>> #FFE0E0
  BackgroundColor<<DTO>> #ECECEC
  BackgroundColor<<Scheduler>> #FFE8CC
}
hide empty members
hide circle

class View <<View>>

class OccasionController <<Controller>> {
  mine(user): List<OccasionResponse>
  create(user, request): 201 OccasionResponse
  update(user, id, request): OccasionResponse
  delete(user, id): 204
}
class OccasionService <<Service>> {
  mine(customerId): List<OccasionResponse>
  create(customerId, request): OccasionResponse
  update(customerId, id, request): OccasionResponse
  delete(customerId, id)
  -find(customerId, id): CustomerOccasion
  -apply(occasion, request, actor)
  -toResponse(occasion, today): OccasionResponse
}
interface CustomerOccasionRepository <<Repository>> {
  findByCustomerIdOrderByOccasionDateAsc(customerId): List<CustomerOccasion>
  findByIdAndCustomerId(id, customerId): Optional<CustomerOccasion>
  countByCustomerId(customerId): long
}
class UserRepository <<Repository>> {
  findById(id): Optional<User>
}
class OccasionRequest <<DTO>> {
  title: @NotBlank, max 255
  occasionDate: @NotNull
  notifyAt: optional, LocalDateTime
  recurringYearly: optional, default false
}
class OccasionResponse <<DTO>> {
  id
  title
  occasionDate
  recurringYearly
  nextOccurrence
  notifyAt
  notifyDaysBefore
  notifyTime
  customNotify
  reminded
}
class CustomerOccasion <<Entity>> {
  id
  title
  occasionDate
  recurringYearly
  notifyDaysBefore = 7
  notifyTime = 08:00
  reminderSent
  lastRemindedFor
  createdBy
  lastModifyBy
}
class User <<Entity>> {
  id
  email
  fullName
}

View --> OccasionController : GET /api/customer/occasions\nPOST /api/customer/occasions\nPUT /api/customer/occasions/{id}\nDELETE /api/customer/occasions/{id}
OccasionController --> OccasionService
OccasionController ..> OccasionRequest : reads
OccasionController ..> OccasionResponse : returns
OccasionService --> CustomerOccasionRepository
OccasionService --> UserRepository : create: customer lookup
OccasionService ..> OccasionRequest : reads
OccasionService ..> OccasionResponse : builds
CustomerOccasionRepository ..> CustomerOccasion
UserRepository ..> User
CustomerOccasion "*" --> "1" User : customer

note bottom of OccasionController
  Class-level @PreAuthorize hasRole('CUSTOMER'): other roles get 403 "Không có quyền truy cập."
  Bad body (blank title, title over 255, missing date): 400 "Dữ liệu không hợp lệ" with errors per field.
end note

note bottom of OccasionService
  Rules (400 unless stated):
  - at most 100 occasions per customer: "Bạn đã đạt giới hạn 100 dịp đặc biệt."
  - a one-time occasion cannot be in the past: "Ngày diễn ra dịp không được ở quá khứ."
  - notifyAt must be on or before the occasion date and at most 365 days before it:
    "Thời điểm nhắc phải trước hoặc đúng ngày diễn ra dịp, tối đa 365 ngày."
  - every query uses the logged-in customer id; another customer's or unknown id gives
    404 "Không tìm thấy dịp đặc biệt." (create without a customer: 404 "Không tìm thấy tài khoản.")
  - changing the date, notify time, days before or recurring flag clears reminderSent and
    lastRemindedFor, so the reminder can be sent again.
end note

note bottom of CustomerOccasion
  OccasionSchedule (static helper, not a bean, no DB access):
  - nextOccurrence: a one-time occasion is occasionDate; a yearly one is this year's date,
    or next year's once it has passed (29/02 becomes 28/02 in a non-leap year).
  - remindAt = nextOccurrence - notifyDaysBefore, at notifyTime (defaults: 7 days, 08:00).
  - isDue: remindAt reached, occurrence today or later, and not yet reminded for this occurrence.
  Sending is done by OccasionReminderJob every 15 min (see 13.2).
end note

@enduml
